# JagSpoor Cloud Functions - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env (for local emulator) or set via Firebase CLI.
# Never commit the real .env file (it is gitignored).

# Subscriptions are billed through Google Play Billing (client-side via the
# in_app_purchase plugin). The `validateGooglePlayPurchase` callable uses the
# googleapis androidpublisher API. Cloud Functions runs with the default
# service account by default (needs the "Android Publisher"/"Firebase Admin"
# roles); alternatively set GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON to the BASE64 of
# a dedicated service-account key:
#   GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=<base64 of the key JSON>

# Real-Time Developer Notifications (Pub/Sub) from the Play Console:
# the Pub/Sub topic the function subscribes to is "jagspoor-play-rtdn"
# (see functions/src/entitlement.ts GOOGLE_PLAY_RTDN_TOPIC). Configure the
# Play Console > Monetization > RTDN topic to publish to the same
# project's Pub/Sub topic.

# ── Support email notifications (new user + new subscription) ───────────────
# The onUserCreate / onSubscriptionCreate / onUserSubscriptionUpdated /
# onPricingCreated triggers email support@jag-spoor.co.za via SMTP (nodemailer).
# See docs/EMAIL_NOTIFICATIONS_SETUP.md for the full walkthrough.
#
#   EMAIL_USER=<the SMTP username, e.g. support@jag-spoor.co.za>
#   EMAIL_PASS=<the SMTP password>       ← set as a SECRET, never in this file
#
# EMAIL_PASS is REQUIRED for mail to send; without it the triggers log a
# warning and skip. Store it with:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set EMAIL_PASS
#
# EMAIL_USER defaults to support@jag-spoor.co.za and doubles as the sender.
# It MUST be the full mailbox address (Afrihost cPanel rejects a bare
# local-part username, which yields "535 Incorrect authentication data").
# Optional overrides (all have sensible defaults):
#   EMAIL_HOST=mail.jag-spoor.co.za      # switch to smtp.gmail.com later
#   EMAIL_PORT=465                       # 465 implicit TLS / 587 STARTTLS
#   EMAIL_SECURE=true                    # (legacy helper only — the live path
#                                         derives TLS FROM the port so a stale
#                                         value can't desync 465 vs 587)
#   SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@jag-spoor.co.za  # the recipient inbox

# ── Website-only PayFast ITN webhook ─────────────────────────────────────────
# (Afrihost-hosted pricing page calls PayFast; PayFast POSTs the ITN to
# /payfastITN):
#   PAYFAST_PASSPHRASE=<the PayFast passphrase used to sign the checkout>
